  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/852976591302164510/1204257459577954324/minecraft_title_10.png?ex=65d41328&amp;is=65c19e28&amp;hm=4cd626ff46f1b8e15e9e42365d7a7e9125546e8f1c1fa056a8abcefaab5e6193&amp;\" alt=\"模組標誌\" width=\"1583\" height=\"117\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><em><strong>正確櫻花向後移植</strong></em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">此模組將 Minecraft 1.20 的櫻花木材系列和櫻花樹林生物群系向後移植至 Minecraft 1.18.2。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">這是初始版本，也是我的第一個 Minecraft 模組專案，因此若有任何錯誤、缺少的功能等，敬請見諒。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">如果您發現任何問題請告訴我，我未來將持續更新此模組以改進它！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">功能列表：</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">櫻花樹林生物群系</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">櫻花樹</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">櫻花木材</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">其他方塊（門、柵欄、壓力板等）</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">來自 1.20 的櫻花音效</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">粉紅花瓣</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/852976591302164510/1204261048866312292/2024-02-05_21.00.30.png?ex=65d41680&amp;is=65c1a180&amp;hm=d67a261362a87c0d3bcbcb70b9f50d54594c64f56f7aef122eb2d15c5a6d127c&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"1583\" height=\"828\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/852976591302164510/1204261049382076456/2024-02-05_21.01.46.png?ex=65d41680&amp;is=65c1a180&amp;hm=6f2e8164e21b623f01ce982ce509a7c2d0447c78803bef4bb7dcbf89789c7a51&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"1583\" height=\"828\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/852976591302164510/1204261050183196672/2024-02-05_21.01.56.png?ex=65d41680&amp;is=65c1a180&amp;hm=8eeb68813aa4d281a1a28e7e6c869bb0a2f1d842eb505945b8fedbdc4fa9b318&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"1583\" height=\"828\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/852976591302164510/1204261050686644264/2024-02-05_21.02.11.png?ex=65d41680&amp;is=65c1a180&amp;hm=0a045bd99010c6fa923c905fb4909bff7d630293a6c8c1019a39925963c04f08&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"1583\" height=\"828\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">待辦事項：</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">新增不同的粉紅花瓣狀態</span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/852976591302164510/1204257459317776424/minecraft_title_11.png?ex=65d41328&amp;is=65c19e28&amp;hm=ad23ed5016d05dff92fef4b3960a9c264cf3e3dd6c44ec2d08ef1634fcb91a2f&amp;\" alt=\"Minecraft Forge 1.18.2\" width=\"1583\" height=\"169\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">模組使用 MCreator 製作。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">紋理和音效來自 Mojang。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">模組作者：DeepResonanceX。</span></span></p>",
